@Barber.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5118

GET https://localhost:7145/api/tenant
X-Tenant-Slug: demo

### Register owner
POST https://localhost:7145/api/auth/register
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"owner@demo.shop","password":"DemoPass123","firstName":"Demo","lastName":"Owner","phone":"+491700000001"}

### Register staff
POST https://localhost:7145/api/auth/register
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"staff@demo.shop","password":"StaffPass123","firstName":"Staff","lastName":"Member","phone":"+491700000002"}

### Login owner
POST https://localhost:7145/api/auth/login
X-Tenant-Slug: demo
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"owner@demo.shop","password":"DemoPass123"}

### Refresh (uses the refresh cookie, no body)
POST https://localhost:7145/api/auth/refresh
X-Tenant-Slug: demo

### Logout (expect 204, uses the refresh cookie, no body)
POST https://localhost:7145/api/auth/logout
X-Tenant-Slug: demo

